# This repository is PUBLIC. Anything listed here stays on your machine only.

# --- Secrets and local configuration ---------------------------------------
# Real values live in .dev.vars (local) and `wrangler secret put` (production).
# Only the *.example templates, which contain placeholders, are committed.
.dev.vars
.dev.vars.*
!.dev.vars.example
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
.npmrc

# --- Client data ------------------------------------------------------------
# Casa Pueblo's workbook and any export of it contain private contact details
# and internal notes. They must never be committed: keep them in private/ and
# load them into the database through /api/sync/excel.
private/
*.xlsx
*.xlsm
*.xls
*.ods
*.csv
*.tsv
~$*

# --- Databases, dumps and backups -------------------------------------------
# The local D1 database lives in .wrangler/. Exports of a real database hold
# submissions, contact emails and password hashes.
.wrangler/
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite-*
*.db
*.dump
*.dump.sql
*.backup.sql
backups/

# --- Dependencies and build output ------------------------------------------
node_modules/
dist/
coverage/
worker-configuration.d.ts

# --- Logs and temporary files -----------------------------------------------
*.log
npm-debug.log*
*.tmp
.cache/

# --- Operating system and editors -------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.swp
*.swo

# --- Local AI assistant settings and notes ----------------------------------
.claude/
CLAUDE.local.md
